<div><span dir="ltr">
Hello Guest Collection owner!
</span></div>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
This message is from the SCG administrators.  We are implementing lifecycle
management for Globus Guest Collections: Collections which have had no activity
for 548 days (approximately 18 months) will be deleted.
<em>You are receiving this email because one of your Guest Collections is
included in the list to be deleted.</em>
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
We plan on implementing this on <strong>Monday, November 16th</strong>.
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
Here are the details of the Guest Collection which will be deleted:
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<ul>
<li dir="ltr">
<strong>Unique ID:</strong>
de43f268-d7e9-11f1-ae03-5ec87b775b0c
</li>

<li dir="ltr">
<strong>Display Name:</strong>
<a href="https://app.globus.org/file-manager/collections/de43f268-d7e9-11f1-ae03-5ec87b775b0c/overview">Test3</a>
</li>

<li dir="ltr">
<strong>Parent Mapped Collection:</strong>
<a href="https://app.globus.org/file-manager/collections/2a975852-c740-4ff0-b8df-bc66d4888fc9/overview">SRCC SCG Project Storage</a>
</li>

<li dir="ltr">
<strong>Last Activity:</strong>
2023-06-09 (1244 days ago)
</li>

</ul>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
For more information on the Guest Collection, click on the Display Name above,
or copy/paste the following URL:
https://app.globus.org/file-manager/collections/de43f268-d7e9-11f1-ae03-5ec87b775b0c/overview
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
IMPORTANT NOTE: <strong>Your data ARE NOT BEING DELETED!</strong>
This action only affects the Guest Collection, not the actual data pointed
to by the Guest Collection.
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
ACTIONS TO TAKE: If you are OK with this deletion, you do not need to do
anything; the Guest Collection will be deleted automatically in about two
weeks.
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
If you want your Guest Collection to remain, you have two options:
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
OPTION 1: Do something with the Guest Collection.  Even a simple directory
listing is enough to 'reset the clock' on deletion.
</span></dir>

<div><span dir="ltr">
OPTION 2: Email us at
<a href="mailto:scg-action@lists.stanford.edu">scg-action@lists.stanford.edu</a>
with a request to make the Guest Collection permanently exempt from deletion.
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
You should also
<a href="mailto:scg-action@lists.stanford.edu">email us</a>
if you have any questions about this work.
</span></dir>

<div><br></div>

<div><span dir="ltr">
Thank you for your continued patronage of SCG!
</span></dir>

<div><span dir="ltr">
~ The SCG Administrators
</span></dir>

</div>
